<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>

<preface xml:id="how-to-use-this-book">
  <title>How to Use This Book</title>

  <p>
    Welcome to BHSawesome an interactive AP CSA textbook. As you work your way
    through this book you will encounter a number of interactive activities that
    will ask you answer questions, rearrange blocks of code into correct
    sequences, and write your own Java code which will be compiled and run for
    you.
  </p>

  <p>
    This book is hosted on our class website. As long as you are logged in to
    the website with your school Google account, your answers and code are
    saved automatically and follow you between computers. If you are not
    logged in everything still works, but your work is saved only in the
    browser you are using.
  </p>

  <p>
    The following <url
    href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jn9_HaX3m7s">video</url> introduces
    some of the features of this book. Note however, the video is made for
    CSAwesome, another textbook from which this book was adapted. Thus the units
    mentioned in the video are not exactly the same as in this book but the
    kinds of exercises are the same.
  </p>

  <video youtube="Jn9_HaX3m7s" label="video-intro" />
</preface>
